Difference Between Class Diagram and Sequence Diagram
Class Diagram	Sequence Diagram
Static diagram	Dynamic diagram
Shows structure	Shows interaction
Focuses on classes	Focuses on messages
Used for design	Used for behavior
Steps to Draw Class Diagram
Identify classes
Add attributes and methods
Define relationships
Add multiplicity if needed
Arrange classes properly
